<div class="wbce-section-shell wbce-addons-subpage">

<header class="wbce-section-hero"><i class="fa fa-language"></i><div><h2>{HEADING_LANGUAGE_DETAILS}</h2><p>Informationen zur ausgewählten Sprache.</p></div>
